{"server":"tw","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_03_beg","groupId":"act44side","stageId":"act44side_03","title":"夜逃通告","storyCode":"AT-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"77b8f94c528c0f44fee4795568a1d614b81c28994d22697f894ab8355507bb62","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"慌忙逃竄的萌萌香在關東煮攤遇到了星熊，星熊出手協助萌萌香逃離追蹤。在她們身後，三船開始在電視上發布“尋人啟事”，實則是動員整個御機的人協助自己追捕星熊和萌萌香。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g11_odenstall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神明？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。在我看來，御機大大小小的怪談，都可以用“神明大人作祟”解釋。而我要找的，就是無數神明中的一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你是不相信的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼族多少還是和寺院更親近一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，我也很難想像哪位神明大人有那麼閒，騎著獨輪車詛咒我家的房子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，大多數鬼族都像你這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要找“神明大人”？因為你覺得自己被某位神明作祟了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛好相反，祂幫過我很大的忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不知道從哪一天開始，祂不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是剛剛那個“輪入道”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能，但我沒辦法確定，畢竟我也看不見那輛獨輪車上坐著的神明到底長什麼樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以能不能請你幫我一個忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如你追上了祂，甚至……有幸目睹祂的身姿，麻煩幫我確認一下，祂的長相是否與此類似。"},{"type":"narration","text":"森內從口袋裡掏出一串鑰匙，上面掛著一枚小小的鑰匙圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"招財貓？這個不就是東國菲林照著獸親的樣子刻畫出來的吉祥物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我遇見的神明，除了大小，幾乎和它毫無二致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊小姐，既然你不是幽靈，那你追逐輪入道，想必也是想知道自己的老宅裡發生了什麼事，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森內老闆，我並沒有對你做過自我介紹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是金石會的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）不是。金石會的人怎麼會跑來這裡擺攤呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警方的線人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）那我真的是不要命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情報販子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不點頭也不搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，也是，哪個情報販子會承認自己是做這行的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是生意，拜託我幫你做事，卻隻字不提回報，這樣不太好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那星熊小姐想要什麼回報呢？如果是情報，我可以知無不言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不忙，等我知道自己需要什麼情報的時候再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼說了會惹來殺身之禍的東西嗎？這種東西最好提前跟我打好招呼，要是臨時才說，我可是不會答應的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，如果你真的能幫我找到有用的線索，我沒有什麼不能說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一言為定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一言為定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，接下來我該去哪裡找那位輪入道？神社？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別忘了，我們腳下這座城市就叫“南院行在御機大社”，總不至於讓我把這裡所有的神社通通都跑一遍吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢。知道俗稱“結緣的神社”的那一間嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"略有耳聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，既然你知道得這麼清楚，為什麼不自己去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神明是很隨心所欲的。祂們願意在一些人面前現身，在另一些人面前卻無論如何都不願被看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你是“另一類人”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從那位神明離我而去之後，我就一直是了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆！我的電動車壞了，你快點幫我修一下，有人在追我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！怎麼是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你到現在還把我當幽靈啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你、你不是幽靈嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香？怎麼這麼慌張？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在追我！我騎著電動車好不容易甩掉他們，但騎到這附近車就故障了，麻煩請你幫我修一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰在追你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是澪小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪？那我勸你乖乖跟她回去。熱量又超標了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，她是要……要處理掉我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我家電視晚上突然壞了，放了很多恐怖的東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有她和三船先生的聊天！他們說——不是處理，就是礦石病！幫幫我！"},{"type":"narration","text":"萌萌香開始語無倫次。\n森內還沒動作，星熊已經走到電動車旁邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"處理？礦石病？萌萌香小姐，你惹到他們了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是發了一篇貼文，我沒想做什麼，也不是什麼勾結鐵齋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勾結鐵齋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看一下這台車怎麼修。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然你還是先去追輪入道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情報販子先生，你還要裝作聽不懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說我已經兩次嚇到這位萌萌香小姐了。現在她有麻煩，我也該做點力所能及的事，就當是還人情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香小姐，我可以保證，只要有我在，你就不會有事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——仁田街那邊是不是有人跑過來了？他們是來追我的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金石會的打扮……看樣子還真的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆！幽靈小姐！救我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幽靈小姐？我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，但我也不知道你叫什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，你的車修好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你騎車，其他的事情交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幽靈小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1907_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，跑來這裡了啊，“萌萌親”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1907_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乖乖跟我們回去，誰也不會對你怎麼樣的。聽話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪、澪小姐呢？我要找她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在幹嘛？跟我們談條件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就老實告訴你吧，如果你乖乖的，今天的事我們都可以當沒發生過。如果你繼續跑，我們就不保證你漂亮的臉蛋上不留傷疤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是先擔心一下你們自己吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你算哪根蔥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，你先走，我來收拾他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能丟下你一個人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就把後座交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（難懂的彈舌）別*東國粗口*在那裡虛張聲勢了，你算什麼東西，給我滾開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發動引擎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別想逃，給我*東國粗口*過來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"萌萌香發動引擎，獨角的鬼跳上車後座，黑道的武器揮空，一切都發生在同一瞬間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的黑道","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*東國粗口*，放箭，放箭！把那個礙事的鬼和那輛破車都給我射成刺蝟！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你專心騎車，能騎多快騎多快，其他的全都交給我。"},{"type":"narration","text":"萌萌香根本聽不進去，她本來就哭得上氣不接下氣，現在更是嚇得放聲大哭。\n但哭歸哭，此後好像確實不再有弩箭飛過來，她身後只剩下金屬碰撞的叮噹聲和人撞在什麼東西上的悶響。\n她不知道後面發生了什麼事情，無論如何也放不下心，只能一邊哭一邊轉頭看向後方——\n弩箭、匕首、撲過來的亡命徒，一切都撞在“幽靈小姐”手裡那面盾上。\n那面盾明明也就半個人高，但拿在獨角的鬼手裡，就彷彿車後面立了一道牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要轉彎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心我。你以前騎過這麼快嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只在拍電影的時候假裝騎過但是我沒辦法我也不想騎那麼快啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拍電影的時候他們怎麼跟你說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"龍、龍頭反打，然後壓車……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就照這個來。"},{"type":"narration","text":"一想到要往轉彎的反方向壓車，萌萌香哭得更大聲了。\n她腦子裡已經浮現出壓車幅度太大，自己和“幽靈小姐”一起飛出去，被黑道團團圍住的情景——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不管了啊啊啊啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"車身在地上擦出火花，但這個彎竟然驚險地轉了過去。\n騎上直路後，萌萌香咬緊嘴唇，死命把油門催到底，強風甚至把她臉上的淚水都刮上了半空中。\n她們身後，追兵的聲音漸漸遠去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g2_jindastreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要去哪裡？我護送你過去，然後去神社，幫森內老闆處理他拜託我的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"森內老闆……拜託你做事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"追蹤我親眼看見的怪談，一輛被看不見的什麼東西騎著的獨輪車。他讓我去神社找找看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"半夜我睡覺時，這個東西突然出現在我旁邊，我一路追著它跑到森內老闆的攤位前面，然後就遇到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"半夜……怪、怪談……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然你害怕，接下來我們還是分開走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，我跟你去。我已經沒辦法回家了，事務所也……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……沒有地方可以去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以，只是你不要再叫得那麼大聲了，會引來追兵的。喉嚨喊啞了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒有！我有接受過發聲訓練，哪怕不在舞台上也要好好遵守發聲方法，不然喉嚨會壞掉的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是哦……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g18_kajistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辦點事情……帶點東西回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是金兵衛讓你送東西給我？不需要。你回去，不要影響我工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊的盾，“般若”，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過她了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算沒見過，前幾年也聽你說到耳朵都長繭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那個陰陽怪氣的面具摘下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我戴面具又妨礙到你了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面具不是你去了金兵衛那裡之後，他慫恿你戴的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說你的喜怒哀樂太過外露，沒有立於人上的氣度，你只會在家發脾氣，拿著那把破木刀亂砍家裡的障子門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說讓你擋住自己的表情，你就老老實實地戴上面具了？你知道那個面具裡面可能藏著什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕藏著炸藥，哪天把我炸死，也跟你沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾。帶著你的破面具，給我滾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我滾？我滾了，媽怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她？她怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是我媽的忌日啊，鐵齋會長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘得一乾二淨。你滿腦子都是你那個重新開張的鍛爐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那也不是你跟著金兵衛那條毒蛇一起混的藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毒蛇？媽為什麼死的？媽死的時候，你做了什麼，他又做了什麼？如果他是毒蛇，你算什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對你的金石會來說，我和我媽到底算什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算了，我們兩個本來也沒什麼好說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去屋裡拜一拜媽。你別攔我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三船先生……時隔多年，又出現在電視上了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g15_higashiroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":"avg_npc_1897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小鋼珠打爽了！明天還得去趟神社，今天就……上樓，回家，睡覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":"avg_npc_1897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天輸了七千五百文，這樣一來，到月底我的生活費還有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":"avg_npc_1897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，勉勉強強夠活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":"avg_npc_1897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了夠了。反正月初就能從鐵齋老爺子那裡領看店的薪水了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":"avg_npc_1897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要不在乎輸錢，小鋼珠打起來就是爽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"洗臉刷牙完畢，開電視，幫終端充電……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"插播新聞？又發生什麼事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，怎麼是他——"},{"type":"narration","text":"吉星猛地從被子裡坐起來，目瞪口呆地看著螢幕裡那張熟悉的臉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":"avg_npc_1897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金兵衛？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_motorroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日誌、快取、硬體記錄……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記錄清理完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從終端機定位，到駭進系統，再到善後工作，一整套流程總共花了差不多……兩個小時？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該驗證的都驗證了。播放錄影，連接即時監視畫面，現場字幕，全都OK。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中間因為訊號波動稍微出了點故障，但都在合理範圍內，下次用的時候再加點安全措施應該就能解決了。完美！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好累啊。好想睡覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然全神貫注兩個小時就已經是極限了。好睏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，不能在這裡睡覺。在金石台的中控室裡睡覺，就算是員工也會被懷疑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還得回去那間又窄又破的辦公室——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？臨時直播？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！得躲起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1259_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我已經到了。等我調整一下機器……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1259_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？不，房間裡除了我以外沒人了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1259_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1259_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經就位。隨時可以開始直播。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g11_odenstall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪小姐？稀客啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本店最推薦的是竹輪，馱獸筋和羽獸卵也很不錯哦。要是宵夜不想吃得太油膩，小店還有白蘿蔔和昆布結——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森內，別裝傻。萌萌香和青鬼去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開個價吧。金石會拿得出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這裡就是一個賣關東煮的地方，怎麼可能知道客人吃完了想去哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"適當的推託可以理解，而過分的抗拒就代表不合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對沒有，絕對沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是不太理解，一個任你們擺布的藝人而已，在城裡舉目無親的她，能跑去哪裡？能對你們金石會有什麼不利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在從我嘴裡套情報嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼敢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪小姐，您跟她在一起也有很長一段時間了，比我認識她的時間還要長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她認識我，也只是因為我做的關東煮好吃，加上對城裡的怪談都熟悉，能隨口安慰她幾句話，老實說，我們兩個也不是很熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算這樣我也看得出來，她就是一個傻傻被人推著走、沒什麼壞心眼的小女生而已。您和她相處的時間更長，您覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你是真的不打算說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話不能這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然這樣吧，麻煩您幫我美言幾句，就說我想著奇貨可居，想要個高價，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您的心裡有怨氣，不然就先來份關東煮墊墊肚子吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竹輪、馱獸筋、羽獸卵、白蘿蔔、昆布結，每種一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪小姐，您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你剛才根本就不想請我吃。萌萌香可以吃，我不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有這回事！就是您以前從來沒在我的店裡面吃過東西，我還以為您不願意賞臉呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪小姐，請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我開動了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她一板一眼地對著食物低頭合十，而後拿出紙杯裡的竹輪，小口咬了下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好燙——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"響徹整個仁田街的嘈雜聲音忽然弱了幾分。\n連帶著街上的人，也像同一棵樹上的羽獸一樣，在同一個瞬間停止了嘰嘰喳喳。\n但沉默只持續了不到幾秒鐘，很快，整齊劃一的聲音從街上的每一台電視裡響了起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位御機的觀眾朋友，大家好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉佔用大家的時間。現在由我三船光平，為各位帶來一則緊急新聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你的老闆有多少年沒主持節目了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"十幾年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……歌手、演員，羽生萌萌香小姐，現在下落不明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"重複一遍，與敝社長期簽約的人氣明星，歌手、演員，羽生萌萌香小姐，現在下落不明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"根據可靠消息，萌萌香小姐失蹤，與城內流傳的怪談密切相關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們尚無法確定，此怪談究竟如何與萌萌香小姐的失蹤扯上關係，但可以確定的是，事件牽涉到此怪談的核心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“金石會的青鬼”、“獨角之鬼”，此人物有許多別稱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她是一名女性，鬼族，獨角，綠色長髮，身材高大強壯，據稱還帶著一面巨大的三角形盾牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她在二十年前下落不明，有傳言稱，她早已身亡，只剩怨靈在深夜的御機街道徘徊，殺死與她相關的人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先前，在萌萌香小姐的演唱會上，不少人都目擊到這個人物的出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至於她究竟是活著的本人，是偽裝者，還是真正的幽靈，我們尚且不得而知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"身為萌萌香小姐簽約事務所的負責人，我在此誠懇地請求御機的各位觀眾為我們提供線索，如有發現，必有重謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香小姐想必也衷心希望各位能為她脫離困境貢獻一份力量……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g11_odenstall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就為了……這個？就為了找萌萌香和那個青鬼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們到底惹到三船什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不理解，澪小姐。萌萌香小姐真的有必要讓你們老闆這麼大張旗鼓嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們兩個有必要讓三船編一張大網，一張由每個看過電視的人的眼睛組成的大網——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"森內覺得什麼東西在自己眼前一閃而過。\n那是一柄短刀。\n在自己絕對反應不過來的一瞬間，短刀插在了關東煮桌台的木板上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果選擇不說，那就最好保持完全的沉默，一句廢話也不要說。記住這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"御機要是沒有你這家關東煮攤，我會覺得可惜的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
